{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>韓國爆紅「迷你搗麻糬」</h2>\n<p>最近韓國網上流行一款超可愛的解壓小物——迷你麻糬。它由韓國品牌 mochii house 推出，外型像一團白白軟軟的麻糬，還附有一把小木槌，可以讓你像搗麻糬一樣，把壞情緒通通捶走。這款迷你麻糬售價約11,000韓元，大約65港元，屬於平價又實用的療癒小物。\n</p>\n<h2>手感回彈軟糯好治癒</h2>\n<p>這粒迷你麻糬手感非常柔軟，可以隨意捏、拉、壓和搓，隨手一捏便會慢慢回彈。工作太累、心情煩躁時，拿在手上玩一會，已經能讓人放鬆不少。最特別的地方，是附有一把迷你木槌。你可以把麻糬放在桌上，用小槌一下一下捶下去，就像傳統搗麻糬一樣。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378642159071539_19978887906aeb0235e0329.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378642159071539_19978887906aeb0235e0329.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378642297475359_16418315106aeb023728fcf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378642297475359_16418315106aeb023728fcf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378642486046723_13163100356aeb02392c633.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378642486046723_13163100356aeb02392c633.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfT-jdIk98H/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:43.735451+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":360,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:54.084643+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:51.920295+00:00","content_hash":"c2a2280d031caaa0bd240df0a8972bbdb919bc150ce7d59c303507f1a8ee2e0d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}